    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sometimes, after heavy rain, water "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "flows",
            "ref": "v-flow"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " onto roads and streets. This is called a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "flood",
            "ref": "v-flood"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Floods can make it hard for people to travel. They can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "damage",
            "ref": "v-damage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " houses, cars, and even farmland."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Hail",
            "zh": "冰雹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is ice falling from the sky. Hail can be as small as a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pea",
            "zh": "豌豆"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or as big as a baseball."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hurricane",
            "zh": "飓风"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is a huge storm. It brings heavy rain and strong winds. It often forms over the ocean."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Very strong winds sometimes start to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "twist",
            "ref": "v-twist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in circles. When this happens, they become a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tornado",
            "ref": "v-tornado"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Tornadoes can move quickly and destroy buildings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blizzard",
            "ref": "v-blizzard"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is a heavy "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "snowstorm",
            "zh": "暴雪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with strong winds. It’s very hard to see in a blizzard."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When it doesn’t rain for a long time, we call it a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "drought",
            "ref": "v-drought"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Droughts can dry up rivers and harm "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "crops",
            "zh": "庄稼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
